 * Source: UI/_registry/watermelon/r/button.json -> src/components/watermelon-ui/button.tsx
 * Snapshot: 2026-08-30 via https://registry.watermelon.sh/r/button.json
 * Keep verbatim per UI/VENDORING-STRATEGY.md — edits only via presetSources declaration.
